--- !yfi/header
version: 1
namespace: recov
---
# `E0212`: `Base` extends `Patch` and `Patch` extends `!ref Base`. Recovery
# drops a back edge so every node keeps a defined view -- but that view is not a
# language semantic (D1.8) and nothing may be read off it. `W0303` used to be:
# it called the contribution inert because the base "already inherits" `note`,
# through the edge the compiler had just invented, and its note pointed at the
# very line contributing it.
Base: !node &Base
  extends: Patch
Patch: !node &Patch
  extends: !ref Base
  note: contributed
